  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[node-sass](https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-sass) just published its new version 3.11.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :warning:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      node-sass\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      3.11.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build kept failing**.\n\n**It looks like your project, in its current form, is malfunctioning** and this update didn’t really change that. I don’t want to leave you in the dark about updates though. I recommend you get your project passing and then check the impact of this update again.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/releases/tag/v3.11.0)\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Better cache reuse for faster installs (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/pull/1566\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1566\" data-id=\"156977109\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1566</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/nschonni\" class=\"user-mention\">@nschonni</a>)</li>\n<li>Respect NO_PROXY when downloading the binary (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/issues/1724\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1724\" data-id=\"178521530\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1724</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/xzyfer\" class=\"user-mention\">@xzyfer</a>)</li>\n<li>Add Node 7 support (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/issues/1766\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1766\" data-id=\"185251398\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1766</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/xzyfer\" class=\"user-mention\">@xzyfer</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Fixes</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>\n<code>SASS_BINARY_SITE</code> typo documentation (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/pull/1744\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1744\" data-id=\"182330845\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1744</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/pselden\" class=\"user-mention\">@pselden</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix links in troubleshooting documentation (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/pull/1753\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1753\" data-id=\"183988336\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1753</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/NicolaiSoeborg\" class=\"user-mention\">@NicolaiSoeborg</a>) </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h4>Supported Environments</h4>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OS</th>\n<th>Architecture</th>\n<th>Node</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6,7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSX</td>\n<td>x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FreeBSD</td>\n<td>i386 &amp; amd64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>*Linux support refers to Ubuntu, Debian, and CentOS 5</p>\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 14 commits .\n\n- [`73726fe`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/73726fe7b28b8dfc82f3e03591fa3488348abae3) <code>3.11.0</code>\n- [`cb328e3`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/cb328e325de6c914432770b3eaaa44af6bca88b7) <code>Merge pull request #1753 from NicolaiSoeborg/patch-1</code>\n- [`4116c38`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/4116c389a5840fbcc7f107c3eeab6aec0a938ba5) <code>Merge pull request #1725 from xzyfer/fix/no-proxy</code>\n- [`5dba770`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/5dba770e05ea37fb833091b8f6d560a8683db9ae) <code>Factor our proxy resolution for testability</code>\n- [`3a4e9c6`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/3a4e9c6c69a0571e20a9ae48885ad23c29200109) <code>Respect NO_PROXY when downloading the binary</code>\n- [`bd6d7a3`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/bd6d7a35cb5791a33cbda0051c6d80ddffd6f0f8) <code>Add Node 7 as a supported environment</code>\n- [`d27ff73`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/d27ff73fe5bed54ce28023b87aa6bc5c30f233a0) <code>Fix links in troubleshooting.md</code>\n- [`360a430`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/360a4308bac15219782fa6f7fe4f46df8d53929e) <code>Merge pull request #1744 from pselden/patch-1</code>\n- [`837ee74`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/837ee744c9cdb996325b19aae307993a87b176ff) <code>Fix process argument binary configuration example</code>\n- [`04e74f4`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/04e74f45fa769dc229356e338c798f0f7e3be834) <code>Restore pkg in install.js</code>\n- [`abce8c1`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/abce8c1aa2a852ef31ce8e2b8c93a39665b876a6) <code>Merge pull request #1714 from nschonni/npm-download-cache</code>\n- [`63d103f`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/63d103fab2e8cc1ef84af2deaac71d5c2070c2bc) <code>Merge pull request #1733 from xzyfer/feat/poc-testing-install</code>\n- [`b1188bc`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/b1188bc9f212aacae6adb2cb15dc793f1842651e) <code>POC for adding unit test coverage to install</code>\n- [`b655852`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/b6558523aaaa29360b50b784e7155fd157cef038) <code>Install: Use a cache folder for binary download</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/compare/7e27148d834dc2b092f4882895a0b18e70c4bbea...73726fe7b28b8dfc82f3e03591fa3488348abae3).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
